@Life.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5049

# Example API calls for Life API
# Update the host address above to match your running instance

### Upload a board
POST {{Life.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/boards/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Width": 5,
  "Height": 5,
  "Alive": [
    [1, 1],
    [2, 2],
    [3, 3]
  ]
}

